Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:03:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/61] nxhost: take the module list from the prepared layouts

main.rs, loader.rs and build.rs hardcoded [main, subsdk0, sdk] (MK8DX).
Splatoon 3 ships main and sdk only. loader::module_names() now returns the
modules that have a .layout in the prepared directory, in Horizon load order
(main, subsdk0..9, sdk; rtld is never run). On iOS, build.rs embeds the same
set and generates the extern statics and lookup() that loader.rs used to
spell out by hand. MK8DX resolves to the same three modules as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013yetZ2nJDh2A6QWpF2QWuu
